# Kazuha Hub RADIUS proxy: the control socket radmin uses to read the state of
# the central servers. Only root can reach it: the socket is read-only and the
# directory holding it belongs to the daemon.
# Rendered from the OPNsense configuration; manual edits are overwritten.

listen {
	type = control
	socket = ${run_dir}/${name}.sock
	mode = ro
}
